sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as Page (Cloudflare Pages)
    participant F as Pages Functions (/api/...)
    participant D1 as D1 database
    participant R2 as R2 bucket
    U->>P: open the app (already logged in: cookie)
    P->>F: GET /api/history
    F->>D1: SELECT the 20 latest searches
    D1-->>F: rows (date, file, best match, distance)
    F-->>P: past searches (JSON)
    P->>F: GET /api/images/<id> (one per row)
    F->>R2: read the uploaded plan
    R2-->>F: image
    F-->>P: thumbnail
    P-->>U: table of past searches
    U->>P: click "Open" on a past search
    P->>F: GET /api/searches/<id>
    F->>D1: SELECT the row (where its answer is stored)
    F->>R2: read results/<id>.json
    R2-->>F: the stored answer (5 matches, images, room maps)
    F-->>P: the past search again
    P-->>U: the plan and its 5 similar plans, no new call to the model
